a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:32px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/ngwaf-module-golang/">Next-Gen WAF for Go</a></li><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:32px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/ngwaf-module-nodejs/">Next-Gen WAF for Node.js</a></li><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:32px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/ngwaf-module-haproxy/">Next-Gen WAF for HAProxy</a></li><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:32px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/ngwaf-tanzu-tile/">Next-Gen WAF for VMWare Tanzu Tile</a></li><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:32px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/ngwaf-heroku-buildpack/">Next-Gen WAF Heroku Buildpack</a></li><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:32px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/ngwaf-ibm-cloud-buildpack/">Next-Gen WAF IBM Cloud Buildpack</a></li><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:32px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/ngwaf-rules/">Next-Gen WAF rules</a></li></ul></div></li></ul><div aria-hidden="true" style="height:1px"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="_14yjd03d _14yjd03c" style="visibility:hidden"></div></nav></aside><button class="sidebar-module--mobileSidebarToggle--f6ff5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sidebar">Navigate to...</button><aside class="wy5jil1e wy5jilh _14yjd035" data-swiftype-index="false"><nav class="_14yjd036" data-orientation="vertical"><div aria-hidden="true" style="height:1px"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="_14yjd03e _14yjd03c" style="visibility:hidden"></div><ul class="wy5jilfu wy5jilvt wy5jilj1 wy5jilsm"><h4 class="_1755uy67 sidebar-module--sidebarTitle--d6055">Labels</h4><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:16px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/added/">ADDITIONS</a></li><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:16px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/changed/">CHANGES</a></li><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:16px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/deprecated/">DEPRECATIONS</a></li><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:16px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/fixed/">FIXES</a></li><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:16px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/new/">NEW</a></li><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:16px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/removed/">REMOVES ITEMS</a></li><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:16px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/security/">SECURITY</a></li><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:16px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/updated/">UPDATED</a></li></ul><div aria-hidden="true" style="height:1px"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="_14yjd03d _14yjd03c" style="visibility:hidden"></div></nav></aside><button class="sidebar-module--mobileSidebarToggle--f6ff5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sidebar">Navigate to...</button><aside class="wy5jil1e wy5jilh _14yjd035" data-swiftype-index="false"><nav class="_14yjd036" data-orientation="vertical"><div aria-hidden="true" style="height:1px"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="_14yjd03e _14yjd03c" style="visibility:hidden"></div><ul class="wy5jilfu wy5jilvt wy5jilj1 wy5jilsm"><h4 class="_1755uy67 sidebar-module--sidebarTitle--d6055">Recent changes</h4><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:16px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/2026/11/terraform-provider-fastly-beta-0.2.8/">Fastly Terraform Provider (beta) 0.2.8</a></li><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:16px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/2026/11/ngwaf-agent-4.83.2/">Next-Gen WAF agent 4.83.2</a></li><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:16px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/2026/11/terraform-provider-fastly-beta-0.2.7/">Fastly Terraform Provider (beta) 0.2.7</a></li><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:16px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/2026/11/javascript-sdk-4.1.0/">JavaScript SDK 4.1.0</a></li><li class="_14yjd038" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" style="scroll-margin-top:18px"><a class="_14yjd039" style="margin-left:16px;padding-left:24px;text-indent:-16px;white-space:normal" data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" href="/documentation/reference/changes/2026/10/terraform-provider-fastly-beta-0.2.6/">Fastly Terraform Provider (beta) 0.2.6</a></li></ul><div aria-hidden="true" style="height:1px"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="_14yjd03d _14yjd03c" style="visibility:hidden"></div></nav></aside></div><section class="mdx-module--content--7121b" translate="no"><ol class="breadcrumbs-module--breadcrumbs--2ba22"><li><a class="" href="/documentation/">Home</a></li><li><a class="" href="/documentation/reference/">Reference documentation</a></li><li><a class="" href="/documentation/reference/changes/">Changelog</a></li><li><a class="" href="/documentation/reference/changes/2026/">2026</a></li><li><a class="" href="/documentation/reference/changes/2026/10/">October 2026</a></li></ol><div class="mdx-module--header--b7ea5"><div class="mdx-module--headerTopLine--a7692"><div class="mdx-module--title--0a109"><h1 class="_1755uy64">Added virtual patch for CVE-2026-109618 and CVE-2026-109619</h1></div><div class="mdx-module--headerActions--a504c"></div></div></div><div translate="yes"><div class="post-module--meta--5017b"><div class="post-module--postDate--f81ad">October 21, 2026</div><span class="label-list-module--labelList--77166 label-list-module--withBackground--74b4d label-list-module--small--f1048"><a class="blueLink" href="/documentation/reference/changes/ngwaf-announcements">ngwaf-announcements</a><a class="blueLink" href="/documentation/reference/changes/added">added</a></span></div><p>Fastly has created a virtual patch for CVE-2026-109618 and CVE-2026-109619 (php2shell) that is now available within your account. On 10/21/2026, two critical PHP vulnerabilities, CVE-2026-109618 and CVE-2026-109619 (php2shell), were announced. They may allow unauthenticated attackers to achieve remote code execution (RCE) or cause a denial of service (DoS). You may be affected if you run a PHP version earlier than 8.5.12, 8.4.27, 8.3.36, or 8.2.35, including all releases of 8.1 and earlier. Fastly has combined both CVE-2026-109618 and CVE-2026-109619 into one virtual patch. To activate it and add protection to your services, follow the steps for your control panel below.</p><h2 class="_1755uy67" id="next-gen-waf-control-panel" style="position:relative"><a href="#next-gen-waf-control-panel" aria-label="Next-Gen WAF control panel permalink" class="anchor before blueLink"><span></span></a>Next-Gen WAF control panel</h2><div class="tabbed-panels-module--container--e993b"><ol><li class="tabbed-panels-module--selected--634ac">Professional or Premier platform</li><li>Essential platform</li></ol><div class="tabbed-panels-module--panel--9fee7"><ol class="columns-list-module--columnList1--1cc0b"><li><p>Log in to the <a href="https://dashboard.signalsciences.net" class="blueLink link-module--externalLink--a1276" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Next-Gen WAF control panel</a>.</p></li><li><p>From the <strong>Sites</strong> menu, select a site if you have more than one site.</p></li><li>From the <strong>Rules</strong> menu, select <strong>Templated Rules</strong>.</li><li>In the search bar, enter <code>CVE-2026-109618</code> and then click <strong>View</strong> for the CVE-2026-109618 templated rule.</li><li>Click <strong>Configure</strong> and then <strong>Add trigger</strong>.</li><li>Select the <strong>Block requests from an IP immediately if the CVE-2026-109618 signal is observed</strong> checkbox.</li><li>Click <strong>Update rule</strong>.</li></ol></div><div hidden="" class="tabbed-panels-module--panel--9fee7"><ol class="columns-list-module--columnList1--1cc0b"><li><p>Log in to the <a href="https://dashboard.signalsciences.net" class="blueLink link-module--externalLink--a1276" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Next-Gen WAF control panel</a>.</p></li><li><p>From the <strong>Sites</strong> menu, select a site if you have more than one site.</p></li><li>Click the <strong>Signals</strong> tab.</li><li>In the search bar, enter <code>CVE-2026-109618</code> and then click <strong>View</strong> for the CVE-2026-109618 tag.</li><li>Click the <strong>Configuration</strong> in the top right corner of the screen.</li><li>Click the <strong>Detections</strong> tab and then <strong>Add detection</strong>.</li><li>Verify the switch is set to <strong>Enabled</strong>.</li><li>Click <strong>Create detection</strong>.</li><li>Click the <strong>Alerts</strong> tab and then <strong>Add alert</strong>.</li><li>In the <strong>Status</strong> area, set the switch to <strong>Enabled</strong>.</li><li>Click <strong>Save alert</strong>.</li></ol></div></div><h2 class="_1755uy67" id="fastly-control-panel" style="position:relative"><a href="#fastly-control-panel" aria-label="Fastly control panel permalink" class="anchor before blueLink"><span></span></a>Fastly control panel</h2><ol class="columns-list-module--columnList1--1cc0b"><li><p>Log in to the <a href="https://manage.fastly.com" class="blueLink link-module--externalLink--a1276" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Fastly control panel</a>.</p></li><li><p>Go to <strong>Security</strong> &gt; <strong>Next-Gen WAF</strong> &gt; <a href="https://manage.fastly.com/security/ngwaf/workspaces" class="blueLink"><strong>Workspaces</strong></a>.</p></li><li>Click <strong>Virtual Patches</strong>.</li><li>In the search bar, enter <code>CVE-2026-109618</code>.</li><li>Click the <strong>Status</strong> switch to the <strong>Enabled</strong> position.</li><li><em>(Optional)</em> If your workspace is in blocking mode, choose whether to <strong>Block requests</strong> or <strong>Log requests</strong> if the CVE-2026-109618 signal is observed.</li><li>Click <strong>Update virtual patch</strong>.</li></ol><div class="post-module--prevNext--5180e"><p>Prior change: <a class="blueLink" href="/documentation/reference/changes/2026/10/added-virtual-patch-for-cve-2026-103849/">Added protection for CVE-2026-103849: Adobe Commerce and Magento Improper Neutralization of Special Elements Used in a Template Engine (BlockStrap)</a></p><p>Following change: <a class="blueLink" href="/documentation/reference/changes/2026/10/automatically-enable-cve-virtual-patches/">Automatically enable CVE virtual patches</a></p></div></div></section></main><div class="_1yxrmuf0 _1755uy61"><div class="_1yiakkf7" data-search-index="false"><div class="_1yiakkf8"><div class="_1yiakkf9"><img alt="Fastly" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,"/></div><ul class="_1yiakkfa"><li class="_1yiakkfb"><div class="_1yiakkff _1yiakkfc">Products</div><ul class="wy5jil5f wy5jilk wy5jil3h"><li><a data-no-dark-mode="true" href="https://www.fastly.com/products" class="_1yiakkfd _1yiakkfc">Edge Cloud Platform</a></li><li><a data-no-dark-mode="true" href="https://www.fastly.com/products/ddos-protection" class="_1yiakkfd _1yiakkfc">DDoS Protection</a></li><li><a data-no-dark-mode="true" href="https://www.fastly.com/products/web-application-api-protection" class="_1yiakkfd _1yiakkfc">Next-Gen WAF</a></li><li><a data-no-dark-mode="true" href="https://www.fastly.com/pricing" class="_1yiakkfd _1yiakkfc">Pricing</a></li><li><a data-no-dark-mode="true" href="https://www.fastly.com/signup" class="_1yiakkfd _1yiakkfc">Try Fastly Free</a></li><li><a data-no-dark-mode="true" href="https://www.fastly.com/network-map" class="_1yiakkfd _1yiakkfc">Network Map</a></li></ul></li><li class="_1yiakkfb"><div class="_1yiakkff _1yiakkfc">Services</div><ul class="wy5jil5f wy5jilk wy5jil3h"><li><a data-no-dark-mode="true" href="https://www.fastly.com/solutions/professional-services" class="_1yiakkfd _1yiakkfc">Professional Services</a></li><li><a data-no-dark-mode="true" href="https://www.fastly.com/solutions/managed-cdn" class="_1yiakkfd _1yiakkfc">Managed CDN</a></li><li><a data-no-dark-mode="true" href="https://www.fastly.com/services/support-plans" class="_1yiakkfd _1yiakkfc">Support Plans</a></li><li><a data-no-dark-mode="true" href="https://www.fastly.com/contact-sales" class="_1yiakkfd _1yiakkfc">Talk to an Expert</a></li></ul></li><li class="_1yiakkfb"><div class="_1yiakkff _1yiakkfc">Learn</div><ul class="wy5jil5f wy5jilk wy5jil3h"><li><a data-no